  unitName: Greater Fire Golem
  unitId: 87102602
  unitNumber: 7007
  description: 'Amidst the ruins of Orebus, Golems frolic without a care in the world.
    Noel captured several specimens of Golems and his experimentation bore some fruit:
    by merging Golems of the same element together and infusing their cores with
    the alien energy of Distilled Ethers, a new type of Golem is born. These Greater
    Fire Golems possess the ability to further strengthen the bonds and powers of
    Summoned units. However, the Evolution seems to have broken them, leaving them
    to mutter strange, incoherent quotes.'
  summonDesc: Hullo.. Mastering others is strength. Mastering yourself is true power.
  fusionDesc: 
  evoDesc: Hullo.. Mastering others is strength. Mastering yourself is true power.
